#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:5
msgid "Grid settings"
msgstr "网格设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech displays a grid in the `workspace`_ which makes the drawing "
"work easier."
msgstr "QElectroTech在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_，这使得绘图工作更容易。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:9
msgid "To configure the grid displayed:"
msgstr "要配置显示的网格："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:11
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:12
msgid "Go to **General** section."
msgstr "至 **总** 节。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:13
msgid "Go to **Grid + Keyboard** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Grid + 键盘** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:14
msgid ""
"Define the X and Y pixels of the grid cell. The cell size can be between 1 "
"and 30 pixels."
msgstr "定义网格单元格的 X 和 Y 像素。单元格大小可以在 1 到 30 像素之间。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:16
msgid ""
"The number of grid cells displacement using the keyboard or the scroll bar "
"can also be defined at the same section where the grid characteristics are "
"defined. Standard and accurate scroll (with **ALT** key) can be defined."
msgstr "使用键盘或滚动条的网格单元格移位数也可以在定义网格特性的同一部分定义。标准与准确的滚动(带有 **ALT** 键)可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:20
msgid "To display the grid at the `workspace`_, refer to `toolbars`_ section."
msgstr "要在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 显示网格，请参考 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_grid.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech grid settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 网格设置"
